    <statement><p>Given that <m>P(110) = 75</m> and <m>P'(110) = -4</m>, approximate
<m>P(109)</m>.</p>
<p><m>P(109) \approx</m> <fillin characters="6" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>79</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



Using the formula, <m>f(c + h) \approx f(c) + f'(c)\cdot h</m>, with 
the function <m>P</m>,
<me>P(109) = P(110  - 1) \approx P(110) + P'(110)\cdot (-1)
  = 75  - 4 \cdot (-1) = 79.</me>


</solution>
